  "title": "Korean Marinated Flank Steak",
  "description": "Flank steak sits overnight in a sweet marinade before being grilled to perfection. This is a great marinade for flank steak, my mom got it from a Korean friend when my dad was stationed overseas in the Army 50 years ago.",
